# Analytic truncation calculus

This aggregate is the owner boundary for the concrete analytic truncation
calculus used by the motivic t-structure.  It exposes the upper and lower
additive-complex truncations, the normalized cut pair, cochain-level
decomposition short complex and exactness machinery, abelian-envelope
truncations, homotopy and stable images, bounded-source membership, and the
additive and stable distinguished truncation triangles.
